title: Recognition, Partnership and Equal Marriage
subtitle: Begin with marriage and adoption; lesser recognition is the price of defeat or compromise.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_major_reform_card
frequency: 135
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_marriage_reform_timer <= 0 and marriage_reform_settled = 0 and reform_pressure_pending = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.poland_marriage_reform_timer = 3;
Q.marriage_reform_next_stage = Number(Q.marriage_reform_proposal_stage) || 4;
const marriageThresholds = [0, 25, 40, 59, 84];
Q.marriage_reform_threshold =
    marriageThresholds[Q.marriage_reform_next_stage];
const ministryBonus =
    (Q.equality_minister_party == "Lewica" ? 11 : 0) +
    (Q.justice_minister_party == "Lewica" ? 7 : 0);
const koCabinet = Q.government_party == "ko" || Q.ministry_ko_in_cabinet;
const pslCabinet = Q.government_party == "psl" || Q.ministry_psl_in_cabinet;
const p2050Cabinet =
    Q.government_party == "p2050" || Q.ministry_p2050_in_cabinet;
const thirdWayCabinet = pslCabinet || p2050Cabinet;
const thirdWayRelation = pslCabinet && p2050Cabinet
    ? Math.min(Number(Q.psl_relation), Number(Q.p2050_relation))
    : (pslCabinet ? Number(Q.psl_relation) : Number(Q.p2050_relation));
let partnerBonus = 0;
if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
    partnerBonus =
        Number(Q.pis_relation) * 0.15 +
        Number(Q.pis_accept_rights) * 0.10 +
        Number(Q.marriage_pis_commitment) * 7 -
        Number(Q.pis_cultural_position) * 0.05;
    if (
        Q.left_in_government &&
        Q.president_name == "Rafał Trzaskowski"
    ) {
        partnerBonus += 10;
    }
} else {
    partnerBonus =
        (koCabinet
            ? Number(Q.ko_relation) * 0.10 +
                Number(Q.ko_accept_rights) * 0.13 +
                Number(Q.marriage_ko_commitment) * 6 -
                Math.max(
                    0,
                    Number(Q.ko_classical_liberal_share) - 55
                ) * 0.10
            : 0) +
        (thirdWayCabinet
            ? Number(Q.marriage_third_way_commitment) * 5 -
                Math.max(0, 52 - thirdWayRelation) * 0.20 -
                (pslCabinet ? Number(Q.psl_conservative_share) * 0.05 : 0)
            : 0) +
        (Q.marriage_reform_next_stage <= 2
            ? Number(Q.marriage_pis_commitment) * 3 +
                Math.max(0, Number(Q.pis_relation) - 50) * 0.04
            : 0);
}
let palaceBonus =
    Number(Q.president_relation) * 0.08 +
    (Q.marriage_palace_president == Q.president_name
        ? Number(Q.marriage_palace_commitment) * 6
        : 0) +
    (Q.president_name == "Rafał Trzaskowski" ? 8 : 0) +
    (Q.trz_marriage_signature ? 8 : 0);
if (
    Q.president_name == "Andrzej Duda" &&
    Q.marriage_reform_next_stage == 1
) {
    palaceBonus += 10;
}
const publicBonus =
    (Number(Q.lgbt_equality_support) - 40) * 0.34 +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_poll) - 5) * 0.55 -
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.lgbt_equality_backlash) - 55) * 0.12;
Q.marriage_reform_power = Math.round(Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        140,
        Number(Q.marriage_reform_progress) * 0.62 +
        partnerBonus + palaceBonus + publicBonus + ministryBonus +
        (Q.marriage_referendum_mandate ? 18 : 0) -
        Number(Q.eu_progressive_headwind)
    )
));
!}
card-image: img/poland/cards/equality-bill.webp

= An ambitious recognition bill

**Campaign goal:** [? if marriage_reform_defined: [+
marriage_reform_goal_label +].?][? if not marriage_reform_defined: Not yet
defined.?]
[? if marriage_reform_defined: **Bill currently on the table:** [+
marriage_reform_next_label +].
**Passage power:** **[+ marriage_reform_power +]**; this bill needs **[+
marriage_reform_threshold +]**.?][? if not marriage_reform_defined: The first
project action must define the ambitious bill before preparation or bargaining
can begin.?]

[? if eu_progressive_headwind > 0: Europe's rightward shift removes **[+
eu_progressive_headwind +] passage power** from this progressive reform. EU
social and democratic organising can reduce that headwind; it cannot replace
a Polish majority.?]

The limited outcomes are not prerequisites. A closest-person agreement,
registered cohabitation or civil partnership may be worth enacting if Lewica
is forced down from its goal—but any such law becomes the final settlement of
this campaign and closes the chapter.

[? if president_name = "Andrzej Duda": Duda's historical openness to a
closest-person formula makes that fallback easier to save if the maximal bill
cannot survive the Palace.?]
[? if equality_minister_party = "Lewica" or justice_minister_party = "Lewica":
The Equality or Justice Ministry gives Lewica the drafters and implementation
file needed to make the next compromise credible.?]

- @define_goal
- @draft
- @coalition_round
- @cash_relation
- @palace
- @referendum
- @advance

@define_goal
title: Define the goal as marriage equality and adoption
subtitle: The opening bill is maximal; civil partnerships and lesser recognition remain fallback settlements.
view-if: marriage_reform_defined = 0
on-arrival: marriage_reform_defined = 1; marriage_reform_goal_stage = 4; marriage_reform_proposal_stage = 4; marriage_reform_next_stage = 4; marriage_reform_progress += 12; progressive_credibility += 4; news_headline = "Lewica defines marriage equality and adoption as its recognition bill"

Every later concession will now be visible as a concession. The campaign does
not have to earn a closest-person agreement before it is allowed to ask for
equal marriage.

- #poland_card_finish

@draft
title: Keep couples, registrars and family lawyers at one table
subtitle: Free. Preparation +10; preserve the maximal bill and map its fallback clauses.
view-if: marriage_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: marriage_reform_progress += 10; progressive_credibility += 1; news_headline = "Lewica keeps the full equal-marriage bill in legislative form"

The working group records which rights disappear in every narrower fallback.
That makes compromise possible without letting a coalition press release call
hospital access the same thing as equal marriage.

- #poland_card_finish

@coalition_round
title: Negotiate a floor with a possible coalition partner
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Choose KO, the Third Way or PiS and record one pledge.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The coalition round needs one resource.
view-if: marriage_reform_defined = 1
new-page: true

Before power, this establishes the minimum for coalition talks. In cabinet,
it converts a partner's sympathy into a promise tied to one fallback level.

- @round_ko
- @round_third_way
- @round_pis

@round_ko
title: Ask KO to record a civil-partnership and marriage route
on-arrival: resources -= 1; marriage_reform_progress += 8; marriage_ko_commitment += 1; ko_relation += 4; news_headline = "KO records a minimum same-sex recognition floor"

- #poland_card_finish

@round_third_way
title: Make the Third Way name the fallback it would permit
view-if: p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1
on-arrival: resources -= 1; marriage_reform_progress += 8; marriage_third_way_commitment += 1; psl_relation += 3; p2050_relation += 3; news_headline = "The Third Way records a limited legal-recognition pledge"

- #poland_card_finish

@round_pis
title: Open the closest-person route with PiS
choose-if: (left_in_government = 1 and government_party = "pis") or pis_relation >= 15 or pis_negotiation_hostility_relief >= 5 or national_crisis_pressure >= 25
unavailable-subtitle: PiS will not record a recognition pledge without coalition ties, an established channel or national pressure.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; marriage_reform_progress += 8; marriage_pis_commitment += 1; pis_relation += 4; news_headline = "PiS records a channel for limited same-sex recognition"

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_relation
title: Turn accumulated trust into a recognition pledge
subtitle: Choose a 58+ relationship; it falls by 12 and becomes one recorded pledge.
choose-if: ko_relation >= 58 or pis_relation >= 58 or ((p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1) and (psl_relation >= 58 or p2050_relation >= 58))
unavailable-subtitle: No potential governing partner trusts us enough yet.
view-if: marriage_reform_defined = 1
new-page: true

- @cash_ko
- @cash_third_way
- @cash_pis

@cash_ko
title: Spend KO goodwill on the recognition bill
choose-if: ko_relation >= 58
on-arrival: ko_relation -= 12; marriage_ko_commitment += 1; marriage_reform_progress += 10; news_headline = "Lewica spends KO goodwill on legal recognition"

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_third_way
title: Spend Third Way goodwill on a limited recognition pledge
view-if: p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1
choose-if: psl_relation >= 58 or p2050_relation >= 58
on-arrival: {!
if (Number(Q.psl_relation) >= Number(Q.p2050_relation)) {
    Q.psl_relation -= 12;
} else {
    Q.p2050_relation -= 12;
}
Q.marriage_third_way_commitment += 1;
Q.marriage_reform_progress += 10;
Q.news_headline = "Lewica spends Third Way goodwill on limited recognition";
!}

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_pis
title: Spend PiS goodwill on the closest-person route
choose-if: pis_relation >= 58
on-arrival: pis_relation -= 12; marriage_pis_commitment += 1; marriage_reform_progress += 10; news_headline = "Lewica spends PiS goodwill on limited legal recognition"

- #poland_card_finish

@palace
title: Ask the Palace which fallback it would sign
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Presidential commitment +1; preparation +6.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The Palace protocol needs one resource.
view-if: marriage_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
if (Q.marriage_palace_president != Q.president_name) {
    Q.marriage_palace_commitment = 0;
    Q.marriage_palace_president = Q.president_name;
}
Q.marriage_palace_commitment += 1;
Q.marriage_reform_progress += 6;
Q.president_relation += 3;
Q.news_headline = "The Palace receives a fallback legal-recognition protocol";
!}

[? if president_name = "Andrzej Duda": The closest-person route gives Duda a
limited formula he can defend to his own electorate. Every broader outcome
requires a more expensive promise.?][? if president_name = "Rafał Trzaskowski":
Trzaskowski is broadly sympathetic, but an explicit protocol still prevents
coalition partners from using the Palace as an excuse for delay.?][? if
president_name != "Andrzej Duda" and president_name != "Rafał Trzaskowski":
The President must now name a signable floor rather than offer generic respect
for families.?]

- #poland_card_finish

@referendum
title: Seek a public mandate for legal recognition
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. A difficult route shaped by equality support, polling and backlash.
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and resources >= 1 and marriage_reform_progress >= 35 and lgbt_equality_support >= 52 and marriage_referendum_mandate = 0
unavailable-subtitle: Requires governing authority, one resource, 35 preparation and 52% equality support.
view-if: marriage_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
const referendumVariation =
    Math.floor((this.random.uint32() / 4294967296) * 11) - 5;
Q.marriage_referendum_score = Math.round(
    17 + Number(Q.lgbt_equality_support) * 0.44 +
    Number(Q.left_poll) * 0.50 +
    Number(Q.marriage_reform_progress) * 0.16 -
    Number(Q.lgbt_equality_backlash) * 0.18 +
    (Number(Q.marriage_ko_commitment) +
        Number(Q.marriage_pis_commitment) +
        Number(Q.marriage_third_way_commitment)) * 2 +
    referendumVariation
);
if (Q.marriage_referendum_score >= 50) {
    Q.marriage_referendum_mandate = 1;
    Q.marriage_reform_progress += 12;
    Q.progressive_credibility += 6;
    Q.public_trust += 2;
    Q.marriage_referendum_result = "A majority endorsed legal recognition";
    Q.news_headline = "A national vote gives legal recognition a public mandate";
} else {
    Q.marriage_reform_progress = Math.max(
        Number(Q.marriage_reform_stage) * 20,
        Number(Q.marriage_reform_progress) - 8
    );
    Q.marriage_reform_proposal_stage =
        Number(Q.marriage_reform_goal_stage) || 4;
    Q.poland_marriage_reform_timer = 6;
    Q.progressive_credibility -= 2;
    Q.public_trust -= 2;
    Q.lgbt_equality_backlash += 6;
    Q.marriage_referendum_result = "The recognition mandate fell short";
    Q.news_headline = "The legal-recognition referendum campaign falls short";
}
!}
go-to: referendum_result

@referendum_result
title: The recognition count
new-page: true

**Campaign score: [+ marriage_referendum_score +].** [+
marriage_referendum_result +].

[? if marriage_referendum_mandate: The mandate weakens every coalition veto
without pretending that a public campaign has itself rewritten family law.
The Sejm and President remain the next project rounds.?][? if not
marriage_referendum_mandate: The loss forces a six-month regroup, but the
ambitious goal and draft survive. The project card returns afterward: full
equality is delayed, not erased.?]

- #poland_card_finish

@advance
title: Table the bill: [+ marriage_reform_next_label +]
subtitle: Requires government and passage power at or above the displayed threshold; resistance may force a narrower final settlement.
view-if: marriage_reform_defined = 1
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and marriage_reform_power >= marriage_reform_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: We either lack executive access or have not assembled enough coalition, public and presidential power.
on-arrival: reform_pressure_issue = "marriage"; reform_pressure_target_stage = marriage_reform_proposal_stage; reform_pressure_previous_stage = 0; reform_pressure_return_mode = "card"; reform_pressure_palace_override = 0; reform_pressure_referendum_used = 0
go-to: poland_major_reforms.resolve
